### Render home as HTML
POST http://127.0.0.1:9901/render?format=html&template=home
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "props": {
    "title": "Welcome to the catalog"
  }
}

### Render invoice as HTML
POST http://127.0.0.1:9901/render?format=html&template=invoice
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "props": {
    "number": "A-42",
    "total": "R$ 129,90"
  }
}
